F. Not included
   - Firmware (rtw8852b_fw-2.bin, rtl8852bu_fw.bin, rtl8852bu_config.bin) is
     not in this repository. It comes from linux-firmware; the tested SHA256
     values are in firmware/SHA256SUMS and firmware/rtl_bt/SHA256SUMS.
     Licence: firmware/LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt (Realtek). The build
     scripts copy that licence into every package that contains firmware.
   - Windows Driver Kit, Windows SDK, Visual Studio Build Tools, LLVM: not
     distributed. Get them from their vendors (packages.config lists the
     WDK and SDK NuGet packages). The driver links WDK libraries
     (WificxTLVGenParse.lib, libcntpr.lib, ksecdd.lib, usbd.lib) at build time.
